<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Ghana Airways plane crash lands in Abidjan.</title>
<headline>Ghana Airways plane crash lands in Abidjan.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Ghana Airways airliner carrying 97 people on a flight from Ghana's capital Accra crash landed at Ivory Coast's international airport in Abidjan on Saturday, state television reported.</p>
<p>No one was killed in the accident and most of those on board escaped unhurt, passengers told the television station. A handful were taken to hospital, one said.</p>
<p>There was no immediate word from the company or airport authorities on the cause of the incident, the television said.</p>
</text>
